Addresses review feedback on #516 to make `TextHeightPaddingMultiplier` a static field.

## Changes

- Changed `TextHeightPaddingMultiplier` from instance field to `public static float` in `CCTexture2D`

This aligns with the existing pattern for configuration fields in the class (`DefaultAlphaPixelFormat`, `OptimizeForPremultipliedAlpha`, `PreserveSourceSurfaceFormat`), which are all static. The field is used consistently as a class-level configuration constant throughout the codebase.

```csharp
public class CCTexture2D : CCGraphicsResource
{
    public static SurfaceFormat DefaultAlphaPixelFormat = SurfaceFormat.Color;
    public static bool OptimizeForPremultipliedAlpha = true;
    public static bool PreserveSourceSurfaceFormat = true;
    public static float TextHeightPaddingMultiplier = 3f;  // Now static

    // ...
}
```

